			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Use stable workspace identifier based on configuration or folder URI\n\nEliminate epoch-timestamp instability from `GetWorkspaceIdentifier` in `Source/ApplicationState/State/ApplicationState.rs` so the identifier remains constant across restarts for the same workspace. Prefer `Workspace.GetConfigurationPath()`; otherwise derive from the first workspace folder URI, with a `NO_WORKSPACE` sentinel when neither is available.\n\nRemove the now-redundant `ApplicationState.rs.backup` and `Internal.rs.backup` files from `Source/ApplicationState/` as part of cleanup.\n\nA stable key supports deduplication in recently-opened lists, per-workspace storage paths, and reliable window-title derivation.",
